    <code code="11348-0" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Past illness note"/>
    <title>Past Medical History</title>
    <text><paragraph>Historical biography with true dates. These events are not part of the synthetic care timeline.</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Historical date</th><th>History</th><th>Evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1977</td><td>Breast tumor found by a doctor, benign after about three weeks of uncertainty</td><td>D (CLM-0003)</td></tr><tr><td>1978</td><td>Lump in the right breast found at self-examination on Labor Day, followed by a diagnosis of breast cancer and a mastectomy; she declined a breast prosthesis</td><td>D (CLM-0004, CLM-0005)</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

